  "metadata": {
    "title": "Soft prompts train at the input; prefixes train at every layer",
    "description": "Soft prompt tuning prepends learned vectors at the input while the Transformer remains frozen. Prefix tuning adds trainable key/value prefix vectors at every layer. Both store a small task-specific component and share the frozen base model."
  }
